      "id": "claim_49b3d3cd2bf745ebaa333d6bce0759bc",
      "statement": "linkkeep.cli.main.build_parser registers 7 subparsers (add, list, remove, count, export, import, tag-overlap); cmd_top_tags is defined in commands.py but no top-tags subparser is wired, so it is unreachable from the CLI.",
