    {
      "id": "claim_b6cc62457c0349159b64ad0d370f8e89",
      "statement": "Store.next_id returns max(current ids, default=0)+1 recomputed on every add, so deleting the highest-ID bookmark causes that ID to be reused; clear() is the only reset (saves [] so the next add starts at 1). There is no high-water mark.",
